WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:07.360
Messenger is where you talk with your child's educators: questions, reminders, and quick updates.

2
00:00:07.610 --> 00:00:10.860
Tap New to start a conversation.

3
00:00:11.110 --> 00:00:15.800
Choose which child it's about, so it goes to the right room team.

4
00:00:16.050 --> 00:00:18.940
Type your message in the box.

5
00:00:19.190 --> 00:00:27.340
Then tap Send message. The educators see it straight away, and you'll get a notification when they reply.

6
00:00:27.590 --> 00:00:34.590
For anything urgent, like an accident or a late pickup, please call the centre rather than sending a message.
